      "description": "Takes the certification decision on ONE test report: applies the DMN the plan's `exitCriteria` names (computed from facts, never asserted) and records the decision as a judgement under the declared `attestations` graph, from which it is signed through `qa-report-signing.bpmn`. A specialisation of `stakeholder` — accountable sign-off — but NOT `judgementOnly`: the exit criteria are a table it applies, and only the decision on top of them is the judgement (owner ruling, 2026-10-01). Never the tester and never the system under test. Bean `3o5b`.",
